; Mount e tooltype sconosciuti nell'icona (os3). Richiede Assign NGNFS:
; Nessun accesso alla rete: i volumi non vengono mai usati.
;   TT6  controllo: tooltype ACTIVATE=1 (mountlist Activate=0). Se Mount
;        legge l'icona l'handler parte subito e crea build/os3-tt6.log
;   TT7  tooltype disattivato "(CASE=INSENSITIVE)"
;   TT8  tooltype attivo "CASE=INSENSITIVE" (sconosciuto a Mount)
; Risultati: NGNFS:build/os3-tt-out.txt
FailAt 21
Set O NGNFS:build/os3-tt-out.txt
Delete NGNFS:build/os3-tt#?.log QUIET >NIL:
Echo "== Version Mount" >$O
Version C:Mount FULL >>$O
Echo "== mount TT6" >>$O
Mount NGNFS:test/tooltype/os3/TT6 >>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Echo "== mount TT7" >>$O
Mount NGNFS:test/tooltype/os3/TT7 >>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Echo "== mount TT8" >>$O
Mount NGNFS:test/tooltype/os3/TT8 >>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Wait 3
Echo "== handler partiti (log presenti)" >>$O
List NGNFS:build/os3-tt#?.log LFORMAT "%n" >>$O
Echo "== Info sui device" >>$O
Assign DEVICES >>$O
Echo "== smontaggio TT6" >>$O
NGNFS:build/os3/NFSDismount TT6: >>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Echo "== smontaggio TT7" >>$O
Assign TT7: DISMOUNT >>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Echo "== smontaggio TT8" >>$O
Assign TT8: DISMOUNT >>$O
Echo "rc=$RC" >>$O
Echo "== FINE" >>$O
